sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant CMux as cmux Multiplexer<br/>8000/TCP
    participant HTTP as fasthttp Server
    participant gRPC as gRPC Server
    participant Engine as Engine Backend<br/>vLLM / SGLang
    participant Worker as Worker Queue
    participant Latency as Latency Simulator<br/>TTFT + ITL + Jitter
    participant RespGen as Response Generator
    participant KVCache as KV Cache
    participant ZMQ as ZMQ Publisher<br/>5557/TCP
    participant Render as vLLM Render Sidecar<br/>8082/TCP
    participant Sub as ZMQ Subscriber

    rect rgb(240, 249, 255)
        Note over Client,RespGen: Flow 1: Inference Request Processing
        Client->>CMux: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTP or gRPC, Optional TLS 1.2+
        alt HTTP Request
            CMux->>HTTP: Route to HTTP handler
            HTTP->>Engine: Validate & parse request
        else gRPC Request (vLLM only)
            CMux->>gRPC: Route to gRPC handler
            gRPC->>Engine: Validate & parse request
        end
        Engine->>Worker: Enqueue simulation task
        Worker->>Latency: Apply TTFT delay
        Latency->>RespGen: Select response content
        alt Echo Mode
            RespGen-->>Worker: Loopback input tokens
        else Random Mode
            RespGen-->>Worker: Probabilistic histogram tokens
        else Dataset Mode
            RespGen-->>Worker: SQLite-backed content
        end
        loop Token-by-Token Streaming
            Worker->>Latency: Apply ITL + jitter + load scaling
            Latency-->>Worker: Delay complete
            Worker-->>Client: SSE chunk / gRPC stream frame
        end
        Worker-->>Client: Final response / stream end
    end

    rect rgb(255, 247, 237)
        Note over KVCache,Sub: Flow 2: KV Cache Event Publishing
        KVCache->>KVCache: Track block-level cache operations
        KVCache->>Engine: Encode events (engine-specific wire format)
        Engine->>ZMQ: Batch msgpack-encoded events
        ZMQ->>Sub: PUB/SUB 5557/TCP<br/>No encryption, no auth
    end

    rect rgb(240, 253, 244)
        Note over Client,Render: Flow 3: Tokenization with Render Sidecar
        Client->>HTTP: POST /v1/chat/completions/render
        HTTP->>Render: Forward tokenization request<br/>HTTP 8082/TCP, no TLS
        Render-->>HTTP: Token IDs response
        HTTP-->>Client: Tokenized result
    end
